a storage; application development and DevOps; content delivery and edge computing; security and ransomware protection; media management; backup, archive, and tape replacement; and Internet of Things. Further, it provides computer backup that automatically backs up data from laptops and desktops for businesses and individuals, which offers a subscription-based software-as-a-service and serves use cases, including MAC and PC backup; ransomware protection; theft and loss recovery; data archiving; organization and managed service provider level management; and remote access. The company serves individuals, developers, MSPS, small and medium-sized businesses, and large enterprises across industries, including media, AI innovators, creative agencies, academic institutions, government agencies, research institutes, and gaming companies. It has a collaboration with WEKA to simplify how AI teams manage data across the AI lifecycle. Backblaze, Inc. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Gleb  Budman | Co-Founder, CEO & Chairman | Age 51 | Compensation: $560,500 (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 320 people. Revenue per employee of $456K ranks in the above the sector median among Technology peers, improving at 21%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $59K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $83K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (10/10).","financial_summary":["Backblaze, Inc. is a small-cap technology business with a $523M market cap on $146M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +20% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +2.9pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at -426% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests. Gross margins of 52% confirm genuine pricing power.","The business throws off $19M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 13 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","Accruals are elevated at -25.6% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin -6.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.4%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 18% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 4.4% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 277% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":2.7689639046279213},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.6) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Technology peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 23% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (11.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Among the least levered in Technology \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Backblaze (BLZE) vs. Its Competitors Head-To-Head Analysis","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/04/backblaze-blze-vs-its-competitors-head-to-head-analysis.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793811527.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.586,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Backblaze (BLZE) Stock Jumps As Q3 Earnings Cement AI Margin Gains","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/software/nasdaq-blze/backblaze/news/backblaze-blze-stock-jumps-as-q3-earnings-cement-ai-margin-g","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793752864.716,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.527,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Backblaze outlines Q4 revenue of $49.8M-$50.2M while targeting 32%-34% adjusted EBITDA margin (NASDAQ:BLZE)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4663134-backblaze-outlines-q4-revenue-of-49_8m-50_2m-while-targeting-32-percentminus-34-percent","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793682596.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.382,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Backblaze Inc (BLZE) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: B2 Cloud Storage S